<div class="widget editor pageStyles narrow" id="divEditor344ac97e-e01e-4a73-b525-919cb1149110" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}'>
	    <div class="fr-view">


        <h2 data-pasted="true">November 3, 2026<br><a href="https://enr.electionsfl.org/POL/3999/Summary/" target="_blank" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(2, 139, 255); text-decoration: underline; outline: 0px;" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" data-pasted="true" rel="noopener"><span style="display:none;">&nbsp;</span><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;</span><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;</span></a></h2><h3 aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" aria-level="2" role="presentation"><br></h3><h3 aria-level="2"><strong style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;">VOTER REGISTRATION DEADLINE: October 5, 2026</strong></h3><p><a href="https://www.polkelections.gov/179/Registration-Statistics" target="_blank" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(2, 139, 255); text-decoration: underline; outline: 0px;" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" data-pasted="true" rel="noopener">Voter Registration Statistic</a></p><p><strong>IMPORTANT DATES (See below for more details</strong>)</p><ul style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 1em 0px 1.4em; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2em; font-family: Lato; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(20, 20, 20); font-size: 15.2px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;" data-pasted="true"><li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.35em; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">Election Day -</strong> Tuesday, November 3rd, 2026 7:00 am to 7:00 pm</li><li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.35em; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">Deadline to register to vote, update information, or change party affiliation -</strong> Monday, October 5, 2026</li><li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.35em; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">Deadline to request that a Vote-by-Mail ballot be mailed to you -</strong> Thursday, October 22nd, 2026, at 5:00 pm</li><li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.35em; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">Early Voting -</strong> Monday, October 19th, through Saturday, October 31st, from 9:00 am until 6:00 pm</li><li style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.35em; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;">Deadline to return your Vote-by-Mail ballot -</strong> Tuesday, November 3rd, 2026, at 7:00 pm to our Election Headquarters or Operations Center.</li></ul><p>Polk County residents who are not registered to vote but would like to participate in the November 3rd General Election, have until <strong>October 5th</strong> to submit their completed voter registration form to the Elections Headquarters in Bartow or at our Operations Center in Winter Haven. Voter registration forms may be downloaded <a href="https://www.polkelections.gov/DocumentCenter/View/386/Registration-Application-Form---English-PDF" target="_blank" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(2, 139, 255); text-decoration: underline; outline: 0px;" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" data-pasted="true" rel="noopener">here<span style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version Options 2026 Primary Election Headline</span></a> and mailed to the Elections Office at: Supervisor of Elections, P.O. Box 1460, Bartow FL, 33831. You can click on the Registration Form Locations link to find a location with forms near you. Registered voters are reminded to update the Elections Office of any name or address change prior to Election Day.&nbsp;</p><h3 data-pasted="true" aria-level="2">Update Your Record</h3><p>Registered voters are reminded to update the Elections Office of any name or address change prior to Election Day. Party changes must be submitted before the<strong>&nbsp;October 5th</strong> registration deadline in order to vote as that party in the November 3rd General Election. A paper registration application form can also be used. <a href="https://registertovoteflorida.gov/home" target="_blank" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(2, 139, 255); text-decoration: underline; outline: 0px;" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" rel="noopener" data-pasted="true">Click here to make changes to your record</a> for the November 3rd General Election.</p><h2>Sample Ballots</h2><p>You can view the ballot you&apos;ll receive on Election Day by visiting our <a href="https://www.polkelections.gov/164/Check-Your-Information" target="_blank" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(2, 139, 255); text-decoration: underline; outline: 0px;" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" rel="noopener" data-pasted="true">Check Your Information</a> page. Your actual ballot will include only the contests applicable to your precinct and residential address. &nbsp;To view a compilation ballot that contains all contests and district races in Polk County, please click <a href="/DocumentCenter/View/839/Compilation-Sample-Ballot-General-Election-2026" target="_blank" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(2, 139, 255); text-decoration: underline; outline: 0px;" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" data-pasted="true" rel="noopener">here.<span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Sample Ballots</span><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Sample Ballots</span></a>.</p><p><br></p><h2>For a list of all candidates in the November 3, 2026 General Election, please click <a href="https://dos.elections.myflorida.com/candidates/canlist.asp" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" rel="noopener">HERE</a></h2><h2 aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" role="presentation"><a href="https://dos.elections.myflorida.com/candidates/canlist.asp" target="_blank" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" rel="noopener"><span style="display:none;">&nbsp;</span></a></h2><h2 style="text-align: center;" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" role="presentation"><br></h2><h2 style="text-align: center;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">3 Easy Ways to Vote</span></h2><ol><li><strong>Vote by Mail</strong>: <a href="/165/Vote-by-Mail" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Request a mail ballot</a> online. Voters have <strong>until Thursday, October 22, 2026,</strong> to request a mail ballot for this election. All voted mail ballots must be received by the Supervisor of Elections by 7 p.m. on Election Day. Return postage is paid for mail ballots. However, voters who prefer to return their voted mail ballots in person can drop them off at any of the listed Early Voting sites during Early Voting days and hours, or at Election Headquarters in Bartow or the Election Operations Center in Winter Haven on weekdays, 8 a.m. to 5 p.m.</li><li><strong>Vote at Your Precinct</strong>:&nbsp;<a href="/163/Where-Do-I-Vote" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Find your polling location</a>.<br>Polls are open 7 a.m. to 7 p.m. on Election Day.</li><li><strong>Vote Early In-Person</strong>: Vote at one of our ten convenient locations,<strong>&nbsp;open from 9 a.m. to 6 p.m. Monday, October 19th to Saturday, October 31st, 2026. &nbsp;</strong></li></ol><h3 aria-level="2" style="text-align: left; margin-left: 40px;">2026 Early Voting Sites</h3><p style="text-align: left; margin-left: 40px;"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1LDSWFSFFDcqFH6VMChuQFi0ERZawqug&ll=28.071730014677858%2C-81.71778369999998&z=11" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Map of All Locations</a></p><ul role="presentation"><li style="list-style-type: none;"><ul style="list-style-type: disc;"><li><strong>Bartow</strong>: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1uRMKJ2DjVLFsmJ-ATlXRmoCuUfY&ll=27.900300450048015%2C-81.8559712&z=20" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Polk Street Community Center: 1255 Polk Street</a></li><li><strong>Davenport</strong>: <a href="https://drive.google.com/open?id=1t4Z_dpm0ib_AtP7hFFMF8w41kdb5wdsK&usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Polk Sheriffs NE District Office, Community Room, 1100 Dunson Road</a></li><li><strong>Haines City</strong>: <a href="https://drive.google.com/open?id=16oISL-JinRYycshtKJRMPQSI0NM&usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Haines City Library, 111 N 6th Street</a></li><li><strong>Lake Alfred</strong>: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1snBbGo55orUv8W5y-R_z1I6KJudKljo&ll=28.10855353905278%2C-81.67983464999999&z=17" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">NE Polk Government Center, 200 Government Center Blvd</a></li><li><strong>Lake Wales</strong>: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/edit?mid=111gtogQDcl5Pczj2sesR27wASsT7w7M&usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Lake Wales Family Recreation Center, 1001 Burns Avenue</a></li><li><strong>Lakeland</strong>: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?mid=1LDSWFSFFDcqFH6VMChuQFi0ERZawqug&ll=28.0522528407432%2C-81.94541926734685&z=18" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Polk County Government Center, 930 E Parker Street</a></li><li><strong>Lakeland</strong>: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1gbHye9Z8knsiRRJttLYzH1GeJq0&ll=28.069306801167617%2C-81.95910755&z=19" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Simpson Park Community Center, 1725 Martin L King Jr Avenue</a></li><li><strong>Mulberry</strong>: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1hWs9u-aVhQTbk9QfH8PSXTn40s4&ll=27.897541362366287%2C-81.96655515833591&z=19" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Mulberry Civic Center, 901 NE 5th Street</a></li><li><strong>Poinciana</strong>: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1TCCGKxoY9NDEgPIZ5-5v_iCMJdg&ll=28.137212309125896%2C-81.46988864999999&z=16" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Poinciana Community Fitness Center, 397 Marigold Avenue</a></li><li><strong>Winter Haven</strong>: <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?mid=1fHSbejoakM3Ojr0p4pPfz5jBHr_r1ew&ll=28.027392938973563%2C-81.7300578&z=17" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Nora Mayo Hall, 500 3rd Street NW</a></li></ul></li></ul><h2 data-pasted="true" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">Need a Ride to the Polls?</h2><p>Citrus Connection is making it easier for Polk County residents to participate in the democratic process by offering free fixed-route bus service to voters during the 2026 General Election Early Voting period and on Election Day.</p><p>The initiative is designed to eliminate transportation barriers and encourage civic engagement by providing convenient, free transportation to polling locations throughout Polk Count. &nbsp;Passengers simply need to present their voter registration card to the bus operator to ride free on any Citrus Connection fixed-route bus.</p><p>For more information and to plan your route, visit <a href="https://ridecitrus.com/services/polk-county-supervisor-of-elections/" target="_blank" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(2, 139, 255); text-decoration: underline; outline: 0px;" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message" data-pasted="true" rel="noopener">Ridecitrus.com</a>.</p>
    </div>

